  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing Vulnerabilities of Displaced Communities through Durable Solutions Programming in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danwadaag project aims to reach 502,320 vulnerable displacement affected individuals across the targeted regions of South West State (SWS), Jubaland, and Banadir (BRA) with durable solutions programming. NRC&#x2019;s role is the lead on Housing, Land and Property intervention (i.a., support land tenure, eviction response strengthening, etc.), establishing WASH infrastructure and provision of shelter for targeted HHs.</narrative>
  </description>
